---
import ServiceLayout from "../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro";
---

<ServiceLayout
  title="Audio"
  subtitle="Custom soundtrack, composition, and audio editing shaped to the work."
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      What this includes
    </h2>

    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-neutral-700">
      <li>Original music and soundtrack composition</li>
      <li>Audio editing and cleanup</li>
      <li>Sound design for video and web</li>
      <li>Mixing and export for final delivery</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      How it’s typically used
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-700 max-w-2xl">
      Audio work is shaped around pacing, tone, and context — whether it’s
      supporting visuals, branding, or a standalone piece.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 p-6 text-sm text-neutral-600">
      Featured audio examples coming soon.
    </div>
  </section>
</ServiceLayout>
